<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-001" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:received" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:received:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">王祥</persName>事後母<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:received:m0005" ref="p8y_56i_5gn">朱</persName>夫人甚謹，</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_A">融</persName>，娶髙平<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0007" ref="bsc_2qz_ht3">薛氏</persName>，生<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>。繼室以廬江<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0018" ref="p8y_56i_5gn">朱氏</persName>，生<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:house:m0022" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AB">覽</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note">後母數譖<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>，屢以非理使<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>，弟<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AB">覽</persName>輒與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>倶。又虐使<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0023" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0024" ref="5n0_ptc_2it">婦</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0026" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AB">覽</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-001-jin033-wanglan:yangqiu:m0027" ref="jmt_uha_exg">妻</persName>亦趨而共之。</p>
</text>
